orporate\" culture. In mid-2022 two internet pioneers decided to bring a better and more cost-effective alternative, and we never looked back.\n\n### Our mission\nIt is our mission to redefine peering, by offering an innovative and cost-effective IXP ecosystem. The current state of peering is not-so-great and in a headlock by large corporate IXP-operators.\n\n### Our way\nWe are truly neutral, fully privately owned and funded. Powered by a new generation of internet pioneers, our goal is to offer transparent and enterprise-ready connectivity services with a human touch.\n\n### About us\nWe are the new-generation connectivity partner, fully privately owned and funded. We have built a next-generation connectivity fabric across major datacenters in Amsterdam and Frankfurt. [Read more](https://www.eranium.io/about) about our initiative.\n\n### Latest news\nConnect now with 400G! Read more about it on our [blog here](https://www.eranium.io/blog/114/the-new-fabric-and-400g).\n\n[RS Looking Glass](https://era-ix.com/lookingglass)", "proto_unicast": true, "proto_multicast": false, "proto_ipv6": true, "website": "https://www.era-ix.com/", "social_media": [{"service": "linkedin", "identifier": "era-ix"}, {"service": "website", "identifier": "https://www.era-ix.com/"}], "url_stats": "", "tech_email": "noc@era-ix.com", "tech_phone": "", "policy_email": "", "policy_phone": "", "sales_phone": "", "sales_email": "sales@era-ix.com", "net_count": 14, "fac_count": 2, "ixf_net_count": 16, "ixf_last_import": "2026-11-23T00:28:50Z", "ixf_import_request": "2026-08-18T06:05:19Z", "ixf_import_request_status": "finished", "service_level": "24/7 Support", "terms": "Recurring Fees", "status_dashboard": "", "logo": null, "created": "2026-03-19T12:28:06Z", "updated": "2026-03-20T12:12:34Z", "status": "ok"}, {"id": 4986, "org_id": 29439, "name": "RegPEX", "aka": "", "name_long": "RegPEX - Regional Peering Exchange", "city": "Ankara", "country": "TR", "region_continent": "Europe", "media": "Ether